// t_61109061.  A function REACHED from the SELECTED ENTRY may not carry a
// RETURN semantic.  One row per AST container that can hold a call - a walker
// that misses a kind under-approximates reachability and ACCEPTS a program the
// reference refuses.
//
// reached through a DECLARATION INITIALISER
// Compile with -e beta.  Reference verdict: REFUSE
float4 gamma(float4 t) : COLOR { return t*2.0; }
float4 beta(float4 t : TEXCOORD0) : COLOR { float4 r = gamma(t); return r; }
